.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-invoices-delete - Delete a draft invoice


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago invoices delete  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
This endpoint is used for permanently deleting a \fBdraft\fR invoice. Deleting a draft invoice removes it entirely: it never becomes accounts receivable, consumes no invoice number, and disappears from every list, export, and analytics surface. Only invoices in the \fBdraft\fR status can be deleted; for a \fBfinalized\fR invoice, void it instead.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for delete


